    "detailed_description": "In this action roguelike shooter you lead an flock of ducks in a vibrant 3D isometric world. Your feathered friends will follow your every move, unleashing their unique attacks on your foes. Navigate through challenging landscapes and face formidable bosses as you upgrade your ducks along the way.<br><br><strong>Gameplay</strong><br>- Control a constantly moving flock of ducks<br>- Collect ducks to automatically attack enemies and gain buffs  <br>- Combine ducks to build a chain of abilities <br>- Gather upgrades during levels <br>- Face-off against bosses after clearing levels <br><br><strong>Features</strong><br>- 10+ Boss Battles <br>- 20+ Levels <br>- Upgrades and Customizations for your flock of Ducks <br>- Vibrant Isometric 3D world<br>- 10+ Steam Achievements",
